// Spec 06: the words of the UI in English, Italian, Spanish, French and German.
// t('key', { vars }) reads the current language and falls back to English, then to the
// key itself; label('status', x) reads a map entry and falls back to x. The language
// comes from the config (ui.language, English by default): main.js calls setLang() at
// boot and whenever the config changes.
//
// LANGS is the list the selectors show, in this order, each language in its own name.
// It must match LANGUAGES in backend/backend/i18n.py (test_i18n.py checks it), and
// every dictionary has the English keys and placeholders (scripts/i18n-test.js).
// Italian has no team.* keys but team.ceo: the labels in default.json are Italian.

